      "label": "common_2110_announce_01",
      "hash64": "1F70B67B077993A5",
      "text": "那麼，第一回合！\\n令人矚目的對戰者是……！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2110_announce_02",
      "hash64": "1F70B37B07798E8C",
      "text": "冠軍[VAR 0x0100(0000)]ＶＳ……",
